# A report never takes the place of what the user just did (#303's review, M2): a board that
# another program writes while a bookmark's message shows is reported after the message's
# time. tests/drive.rs writes Ashfall.canvas, with a card whose id is empty, which the engine
# doesn't take.
size 160x44
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace 35 notes
wait-for canvas couldn't read Ashfall.canvas: card 1 (id "") is left out
wait-gone canvas couldn't read Ashfall.canvas
wait-for ? help  q quit
wait 1000ms
expect-not couldn't read
keys p
type krakatoa
wait-for 1 notes
keys enter
wait-for Volcanoes/Krakatoa  reading
keys B
wait-for bookmarked Krakatoa · ' bookmarks
write Inbox/Tephra.canvas {"nodes":[{"id":"","type":"text","text":"- [ ] Sweep the roof","x":0,"y":0,"width":200,"height":80}],"edges":[]}\n
wait 1500ms
expect bookmarked Krakatoa · ' bookmarks
wait-for 10s canvas couldn't read Inbox/Tephra.canvas: card 1 (id "") is left out
wait-gone canvas couldn't read Inbox/Tephra.canvas
keys esc
wait-for ? help  q quit
keys q
exits 0
